build
!.vscode/*

# Waveshare's full demo package (DVI/USB/MicroSD samples, KiCad/gerber
# files, prebuilt .uf2s). Only Sample Code/01-DVI/apps/hello_dvi is ever
# used by this project (the dvi_reference_sample CMake target, for local
# hardware/toolchain control-testing - see Hardware.md). Not committed:
# keep it on disk locally if you want that target to build.
Sample Code/

# Vendored PicoDVI (github.com/Wren6991/PicoDVI): only software/libdvi/ is
# actually built (the dvi_reference_sample control-test target - see
# Hardware.md). Everything else - PicoDVI's own hardware/board KiCad+gerber
# files, its ~15 unrelated demo apps, libsprite, image assets - is unused
# reference material. Not committed, but keep it on disk locally if you
# want to browse it or build one of those other demos.
lib/PicoDVI/*
!lib/PicoDVI/LICENSE
!lib/PicoDVI/Readme.md
!lib/PicoDVI/software
lib/PicoDVI/software/*
!lib/PicoDVI/software/libdvi
